cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Project Bornomala or its subprojects, please cite as below."
title: "Project Bornomala: A Bengali-First Language Technology Stack"
abstract: >-
  A multi-year programme to build a Bengali-first language technology stack:
  tokenization, document recognition, West Bengal dialect documentation, speech,
  and foundation modelling. The central thesis is that the binding constraint on
  Bengali language modelling is data, not compute.
